 section you choose, every device installed in engineering bay, defines your combat signature. Will your flagship be a glass cannon bristling with spinal-mounted railguns, or an armored leviathan radiating defensive countermeasures?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/72c29218a2610b41ad736a63c5030c32.avif?t=1787016310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras_big/72c29218a2610b41ad736a63c5030c32.avif?t=1787016310 width=800 height=458 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "&quot;The Flagship&quot; is a singleplayer third-person space warship roguelike game. From destroyers to battleships, choose your vessel and equip it to face node-based roguelike challenges, each adventure is a different experience. Your ship, equipment, skill level and roguelike ability build will be tested.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/20117c14e330ee7f2adbb07a89a31470dca5af51/header.jpg?t=1787016310", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/a933c69aa42d5bdd3593b76d8fb4a7704b5d880f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787016310", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/a933c69aa42d5bdd3593b76d8fb4a7704b5d880f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787016310", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core gen 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 